{"key":"enterprise/T1560.002","id":"T1560.002","name":"Archive via Library","domain":"enterprise","level":"subtechnique","parent_id":"T1560","tactics":["collection"],"platforms":["Linux","macOS","Windows"],"environments":["cloud-hosted-endpoint","onprem"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"An adversary may compress or encrypt data that is collected prior to exfiltration using 3rd party libraries. Many libraries exist that can archive data, including Python rarfile , libzip , and zlib . Most libraries include functionality to encrypt and/or compress data. Some archival libraries are preinstalled on systems, such as bzip2 on macOS and Linux, and zip on Windows. Note that the libraries are different from the utilities. The libraries…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1560/002","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--41868330-6ee2-4d0f-b743-9f2294c3c9b6","source_modified":"2025-10-24T17:48:42.345Z","source_object_version":"1.0","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0064","name":"Command Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0064","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--685f917a-e95e-4ba0-ade1-c7d354dae6e0","page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"id":"DC0039","name":"File Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0039","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--2b3bfe19-d59a-460d-93bb-2f546adc2d2c","page":"telemetry/DC0039/"},{"id":"DC0016","name":"Module Load","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0016","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--c0a4a086-cc20-4e1e-b7cb-29d99dfa3fb1","page":"telemetry/DC0016/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0032","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3d20385b-24ef-40e1-9f56-f39750379077","page":"telemetry/DC0032/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0268","name":"Detect Archiving via Library (T1560.002)","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0268","stix_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--a3dcb195-d1b5-4bce-b62b-ba9bdaed56d5","relationship_id":"relationship--61d0daa0-1566-445b-b9ef-1fc5152ab8f7"}],"analytics":[{"id":"AN0747","name":"Analytic 0747","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0268#AN0747","guidance":"Detects adversarial archiving using libraries (zlib, zip APIs) invoked by scripts or binaries. Correlates process executions of Python, PowerShell, or custom .NET binaries with DLL/module loads linked to compression libraries, followed by archive file creation.","platforms":["Windows"],"strategy_id":"DET0268"},{"id":"AN0748","name":"Analytic 0748","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0268#AN0748","guidance":"Detects adversarial archiving by scripts or binaries calling compression libraries (libzip, zlib, bzip2). Correlates execution of Python, Perl, or compiled binaries with dynamic linking to archiving libraries and creation of compressed files in /tmp or user directories.","platforms":["Linux"],"strategy_id":"DET0268"},{"id":"AN0749","name":"Analytic 0749","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0268#AN0749","guidance":"Detects malicious archiving via system or third-party libraries (libz, libarchive) invoked by Python, Swift, or Objective-C binaries. Correlates unified logs of library loads with creation of compressed or encrypted archives (.zip, .gz, .bz2, .dmg).","platforms":["macOS"],"strategy_id":"DET0268"}],"log_sources":[{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"WinEventLog:Security","channel":"EventCode=4688","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0747","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0268#AN0747","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0016","component":"Module Load","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=7","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0747","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0268#AN0747","validation":"upstream_def